#: ../../src/fs.rst:5
msgid "File system operations"
msgstr "文件系统操作"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:7
msgid ""
"libuv provides a wide variety of cross-platform sync and async file "
"system operations. All functions defined in this document take a "
"callback, which is allowed to be NULL. If the callback is NULL the "
"request is completed synchronously, otherwise it will be performed "
"asynchronously."
msgstr ""
"libuv 提供了各种各样的跨平台同步与异步文件系统操作。本文档定义的所有函数都接受一"
"个回调，该回调允许为 NULL。如果回调为 NULL，请求将同步完成，否则将以异步方式执行。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:12
msgid ""
"All file operations are run on the threadpool. See :ref:`threadpool` for "
"information on the threadpool size."
msgstr "所有文件操作都在线程池上运行。有关线程池大小的信息，参见 :ref:`threadpool`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:15
msgid ""
"Starting with libuv v1.45.0, some file operations on Linux are handed off"
" to `io_uring <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Io_uring>` when possible. "
"Apart from a (sometimes significant) increase in throughput there should "
"be no change in observable behavior. Libuv reverts to using its "
"threadpool when the necessary kernel features are unavailable or "
"unsuitable. Starting with libuv v1.49.0 this behavior was reverted and "
"Libuv on Linux by default will be using the threadpool again. In order to"
" enable io_uring the :c:type:`uv_loop_t` instance must be configured with"
" the :c:type:`UV_LOOP_USE_IO_URING_SQPOLL` option."
msgstr ""
"从 libuv v1.45.0 开始，Linux 上的一些文件操作会在可能时交给 `io_uring"
" <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Io_uring>` 处理。除了吞吐量会有（有时是显著的）提"
"升之外，可观察到的行为应无任何变化。当所需的内核特性不可用或不适用时，libuv 会回"
"退为使用其线程池。从 libuv v1.49.0 开始，此行为被回退，Linux 上的 libuv 默认将重"
"新使用线程池。要启用 io_uring，必须为 :c:type:`uv_loop_t` 实例配置"
" :c:type:`UV_LOOP_USE_IO_URING_SQPOLL` 选项。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:25
msgid "On Windows `uv_fs_*` functions use utf-8 encoding."
msgstr "在 Windows 上，`uv_fs_*` 函数使用 utf-8 编码。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:28
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:32 ../../src/fs.rst:73
msgid "File system request type."
msgstr "文件系统请求类型。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:36
msgid ""
"Y2K38-unsafe data type for storing times with nanosecond resolution. Will"
" be replaced with :c:type:`uv_timespec64_t` in libuv v2.0."
msgstr ""
"用于以纳秒精度存储时间的数据类型，不具备 Y2K38 安全性。将在 libuv v2.0 中被"
" :c:type:`uv_timespec64_t` 取代。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:48
msgid "Portable equivalent of ``struct stat``."
msgstr "``struct stat`` 的可移植等价物。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:119
msgid ""
"Reduced cross platform equivalent of ``struct statfs``. Used in "
":c:func:`uv_fs_statfs`."
msgstr "``struct statfs`` 的精简跨平台等价物。用于 :c:func:`uv_fs_statfs`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:138
msgid "Type of dirent."
msgstr "目录项类型。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:156
msgid ""
"Cross platform (reduced) equivalent of ``struct dirent``. Used in "
":c:func:`uv_fs_scandir_next`."
msgstr "``struct dirent`` 的跨平台（精简）等价物。用于 :c:func:`uv_fs_scandir_next`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:168
msgid ""
"Data type used for streaming directory iteration. Used by "
":c:func:`uv_fs_opendir`, :c:func:`uv_fs_readdir`, and "
":c:func:`uv_fs_closedir`. `dirents` represents a user provided array of "
"`uv_dirent_t`s used to hold results. `nentries` is the user provided "
"maximum array size of `dirents`."
msgstr ""
"用于以流方式遍历目录的数据类型。由 :c:func:`uv_fs_opendir`、"
":c:func:`uv_fs_readdir` 和 :c:func:`uv_fs_closedir` 使用。`dirents` 表示用户提供"
"的一个用于存放结果的 `uv_dirent_t` 数组。`nentries` 是用户提供的 `dirents` 数组的"
"大小上限。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:183
msgid "Callback called when a request is completed asynchronously."
msgstr "请求以异步方式完成时调用的回调。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:187
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:191
msgid ""
"Loop that started this request and where completion will be reported. "
"Readonly."
msgstr "发起此请求并在其中报告完成情况的事件循环。只读。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:196
msgid "FS request type."
msgstr "文件系统请求类型。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:200
msgid "Path affecting the request."
msgstr "影响该请求的路径。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:204
msgid ""
"Result of the request. < 0 means error, success otherwise. On requests "
"such as :c:func:`uv_fs_read` or :c:func:`uv_fs_write` it indicates the "
"amount of data that was read or written, respectively."
msgstr ""
"请求的结果。< 0 表示错误，否则表示成功。对于 :c:func:`uv_fs_read`"
" 或 :c:func:`uv_fs_write` 等请求，它分别表示已读取或已写入的数据量。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:210
msgid "Stores the result of :c:func:`uv_fs_stat` and other stat requests."
msgstr "存储 :c:func:`uv_fs_stat` 及其他 stat 请求的结果。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:214
msgid ""
"Stores the result of :c:func:`uv_fs_readlink` and "
":c:func:`uv_fs_realpath` and serves as an alias to `statbuf`."
msgstr ""
"存储 :c:func:`uv_fs_readlink` 和 :c:func:`uv_fs_realpath` 的结果，并充当"
" `statbuf` 的别名。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:217
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_req_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_req_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:221
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:225
msgid ""
"Cleanup request. Must be called after a request is finished to deallocate"
" any memory libuv might have allocated."
msgstr "清理请求。请求结束后必须调用此函数，以释放 libuv 可能已分配的任何内存。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:230
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`close(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`close(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:234
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`open(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`open(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:237
msgid ""
"On Windows libuv uses `CreateFileW` and thus the file is always opened in"
" binary mode. Because of this the O_BINARY and O_TEXT flags are not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，libuv 使用 `CreateFileW`，因此文件总是以二进制模式打开。因此不支持"
" O_BINARY 和 O_TEXT 标志。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:243
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`preadv(2)`. If the `offset` argument is `-1`, then "
"the current file offset is used and updated."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`preadv(2)`。如果 `offset` 参数为 `-1`，则使用并更新当前文件偏移量。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:247
msgid ""
"On Windows, under non-MSVC environments (e.g. when GCC or Clang is used "
"to build libuv), files opened using ``UV_FS_O_FILEMAP`` may cause a fatal"
" crash if the memory mapped read operation fails."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，在非 MSVC 环境（例如使用 GCC 或 Clang 构建 libuv 时）下，使用"
" ``UV_FS_O_FILEMAP`` 打开的文件在内存映射读取操作失败时可能导致致命崩溃。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:253
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`unlink(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`unlink(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:257
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`pwritev(2)`. If the `offset` argument is `-1`, then "
"the current file offset is used and updated."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`pwritev(2)`。如果 `offset` 参数为 `-1`，则使用并更新当前文件偏移量。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:261
msgid ""
"On Windows, under non-MSVC environments (e.g. when GCC or Clang is used "
"to build libuv), files opened using ``UV_FS_O_FILEMAP`` may cause a fatal"
" crash if the memory mapped write operation fails."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，在非 MSVC 环境（例如使用 GCC 或 Clang 构建 libuv 时）下，使用"
" ``UV_FS_O_FILEMAP`` 打开的文件在内存映射写入操作失败时可能导致致命崩溃。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:267
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`mkdir(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`mkdir(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:270
msgid "`mode` is currently not implemented on Windows."
msgstr "`mode` 目前在 Windows 上尚未实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:274
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`mkdtemp(3)`. The result can be found as a null "
"terminated string at `req->path`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`mkdtemp(3)`。结果以空字符结尾的字符串形式存放在 `req->path` 处。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:278
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`mkstemp(3)`. The created file path can be found as a "
"null terminated string at `req->path`. The file descriptor can be found "
"as an integer at `req->result`."
msgstr ""
"等价于 :man:`mkstemp(3)`。所创建文件的路径以空字符结尾的字符串形式存放在"
" `req->path` 处。文件描述符以整数形式存放在 `req->result` 处。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:285
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`rmdir(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`rmdir(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:289
msgid ""
"Opens `path` as a directory stream. On success, a `uv_dir_t` is allocated"
" and returned via `req->ptr`. This memory is not freed by "
"`uv_fs_req_cleanup()`, although `req->ptr` is set to `NULL`. The "
"allocated memory must be freed by calling `uv_fs_closedir()`. On failure,"
" no memory is allocated."
msgstr ""
"将 `path` 作为目录流打开。成功时，会分配一个 `uv_dir_t` 并通过 `req->ptr` 返回。"
"此内存不会由 `uv_fs_req_cleanup()` 释放，尽管 `req->ptr` 会被设置为 `NULL`。已分"
"配的内存必须通过调用 `uv_fs_closedir()` 来释放。失败时，不分配任何内存。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:295
msgid ""
"The contents of the directory can be iterated over by passing the "
"resulting `uv_dir_t` to `uv_fs_readdir()`."
msgstr "将得到的 `uv_dir_t` 传给 `uv_fs_readdir()`，即可遍历该目录的内容。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:302
msgid ""
"Closes the directory stream represented by `dir` and frees the memory "
"allocated by `uv_fs_opendir()`."
msgstr "关闭 `dir` 所表示的目录流，并释放由 `uv_fs_opendir()` 分配的内存。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:309
msgid ""
"Iterates over the directory stream, `dir`, returned by a successful "
"`uv_fs_opendir()` call. Prior to invoking `uv_fs_readdir()`, the caller "
"must set `dir->dirents` and `dir->nentries`, representing the array of "
":c:type:`uv_dirent_t` elements used to hold the read directory entries "
"and its size."
msgstr ""
"遍历由一次成功的 `uv_fs_opendir()` 调用返回的目录流 `dir`。在调用 `uv_fs_readdir()`"
" 之前，调用者必须设置 `dir->dirents` 和 `dir->nentries`，它们表示用于存放所读取目"
"录项的 :c:type:`uv_dirent_t` 元素数组及其大小。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:315
msgid ""
"On success, the result is an integer >= 0 representing the number of "
"entries read from the stream."
msgstr "成功时，结果是一个 >= 0 的整数，表示从该流中读取的目录项数量。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:321
msgid "`uv_fs_readdir()` is not thread safe."
msgstr "`uv_fs_readdir()` 不是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:324
msgid "This function does not return the \".\" and \"..\" entries."
msgstr "此函数不返回“.”和“..”目录项。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:327
msgid ""
"On success this function allocates memory that must be freed using "
"`uv_fs_req_cleanup()`. `uv_fs_req_cleanup()` must be called before "
"closing the directory with `uv_fs_closedir()`."
msgstr ""
"成功时此函数会分配内存，必须使用 `uv_fs_req_cleanup()` 释放。`uv_fs_req_cleanup()`"
" 必须在用 `uv_fs_closedir()` 关闭目录之前调用。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:334
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`scandir(3)`, with a slightly different API. Once the "
"callback for the request is called, the user can use "
":c:func:`uv_fs_scandir_next` to get `ent` populated with the next "
"directory entry data. When there are no more entries ``UV_EOF`` will be "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"等价于 :man:`scandir(3)`，但 API 略有不同。请求的回调一旦被调用，用户即可使用"
" :c:func:`uv_fs_scandir_next` 获取填充了下一个目录项数据的 `ent`。当没有更多目录"
"项时，将返回 ``UV_EOF``。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:340
msgid ""
"Unlike `scandir(3)`, this function does not return the \".\" and \"..\" "
"entries."
msgstr "与 `scandir(3)` 不同，此函数不返回“.”和“..”目录项。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:343
msgid ""
"On Linux, getting the type of an entry is only supported by some file "
"systems (btrfs, ext2, ext3 and ext4 at the time of this writing), check "
"the :man:`getdents(2)` man page."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，仅部分文件系统支持获取目录项的类型（撰写本文时为 btrfs、ext2、ext3"
" 和 ext4），请查阅 :man:`getdents(2)` 手册页。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:350
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`stat(2)`, :man:`fstat(2)` and :man:`lstat(2)` "
"respectively."
msgstr "分别等价于 :man:`stat(2)`、:man:`fstat(2)` 和 :man:`lstat(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:354
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`statfs(2)`. On success, a `uv_statfs_t` is allocated "
"and returned via `req->ptr`. This memory is freed by "
"`uv_fs_req_cleanup()`."
msgstr ""
"等价于 :man:`statfs(2)`。成功时，会分配一个 `uv_statfs_t` 并通过 `req->ptr` 返回。"
"此内存由 `uv_fs_req_cleanup()` 释放。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:358
msgid ""
"Any fields in the resulting `uv_statfs_t` that are not supported by the "
"underlying operating system are set to zero."
msgstr "所得 `uv_statfs_t` 中底层操作系统不支持的字段都会被设置为零。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:365
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`rename(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`rename(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:369
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`fsync(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`fsync(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:372
msgid ""
"For AIX, `uv_fs_fsync` returns `UV_EBADF` on file descriptors referencing"
" non regular files."
msgstr "对于 AIX，当文件描述符引用的是非普通文件时，`uv_fs_fsync` 返回 `UV_EBADF`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:377
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`fdatasync(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`fdatasync(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:381
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`ftruncate(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`ftruncate(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:385
msgid ""
"Copies a file from `path` to `new_path`. Supported `flags` are described "
"below."
msgstr "将文件从 `path` 复制到 `new_path`。受支持的 `flags` 如下所述。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:387
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_EXCL`: If present, `uv_fs_copyfile()` will fail with "
"`UV_EEXIST` if the destination path already exists. The default behavior "
"is to overwrite the destination if it exists."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_EXCL`：如果设置了此标志，当目标路径已存在时，`uv_fs_copyfile()`"
" 将以 `UV_EEXIST` 失败。默认行为是：如果目标已存在，则覆盖目标。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:390
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE`: If present, `uv_fs_copyfile()` will attempt to "
"create a copy-on-write reflink. If the underlying platform does not "
"support copy-on-write, or an error occurs while attempting to use copy-"
"on-write, a fallback copy mechanism based on :c:func:`uv_fs_sendfile` is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE`：如果设置了此标志，`uv_fs_copyfile()` 将尝试创建写时复制"
"的 reflink。如果底层平台不支持写时复制，或者尝试使用写时复制时发生错误，则使用基"
"于 :c:func:`uv_fs_sendfile` 的回退复制机制。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:395
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE`: If present, `uv_fs_copyfile()` will "
"attempt to create a copy-on-write reflink. If the underlying platform "
"does not support copy-on-write, or an error occurs while attempting to "
"use copy-on-write, then an error is returned."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE`：如果设置了此标志，`uv_fs_copyfile()` 将尝试创建写"
"时复制的 reflink。如果底层平台不支持写时复制，或者尝试使用写时复制时发生错误，则"
"返回错误。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:401
msgid ""
"If the destination path is created, but an error occurs while copying the"
" data, then the destination path is removed. There is a brief window of "
"time between closing and removing the file where another process could "
"access the file."
msgstr ""
"如果已创建目标路径，但在复制数据时发生错误，则目标路径会被移除。在关闭文件与移除"
"文件之间有一段短暂的时间窗口，在此期间其他进程可能访问该文件。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:408
msgid "`UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE` and `UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE` are supported."
msgstr "支持 `UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE` 和 `UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:411
msgid ""
"If an error occurs while using `UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE`, that error"
" is returned. Previously, all errors were mapped to `UV_ENOTSUP`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `UV_FS_COPYFILE_FICLONE_FORCE` 时如果发生错误，将返回该错误。此前，所有错误"
"都被映射为 `UV_ENOTSUP`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:417
msgid "Limited equivalent to :man:`sendfile(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`sendfile(2)`，但功能受限。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:421
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`access(2)` on Unix. Windows uses "
"``GetFileAttributesW()``."
msgstr "在 Unix 上等价于 :man:`access(2)`。Windows 使用 ``GetFileAttributesW()``。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:426
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`chmod(2)` and :man:`fchmod(2)` respectively."
msgstr "分别等价于 :man:`chmod(2)` 和 :man:`fchmod(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:432
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`utime(2)`, :man:`futimes(3)` and :man:`lutimes(3)` "
"respectively."
msgstr "分别等价于 :man:`utime(2)`、:man:`futimes(3)` 和 :man:`lutimes(3)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:434
msgid ""
"Passing `UV_FS_UTIME_NOW` as the atime or mtime sets the timestamp to the"
" current time."
msgstr "将 `UV_FS_UTIME_NOW` 作为 atime 或 mtime 传入时，时间戳会被设置为当前时间。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:437
msgid ""
"Passing `UV_FS_UTIME_OMIT` as the atime or mtime leaves the timestamp "
"untouched."
msgstr "将 `UV_FS_UTIME_OMIT` 作为 atime 或 mtime 传入时，时间戳保持不变。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:441
msgid ""
"z/OS: `uv_fs_lutime()` is not implemented for z/OS. It can still be "
"called but will return ``UV_ENOSYS``."
msgstr "z/OS：`uv_fs_lutime()` 未在 z/OS 上实现。仍然可以调用，但将返回 ``UV_ENOSYS``。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:445
msgid ""
"AIX: `uv_fs_futime()` and `uv_fs_lutime()` functions only work for AIX "
"7.1 and newer. They can still be called on older versions but will return"
" ``UV_ENOSYS``."
msgstr ""
"AIX：`uv_fs_futime()` 和 `uv_fs_lutime()` 函数仅在 AIX 7.1 及更新版本上可用。在更"
"旧的版本上仍然可以调用，但将返回 ``UV_ENOSYS``。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:448
msgid "sub-second precission is supported on Windows"
msgstr "Windows 上支持亚秒精度。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:452
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`link(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`link(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:456
msgid "Equivalent to :man:`symlink(2)`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`symlink(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:459
msgid ""
"On Windows the `flags` parameter can be specified to control how the "
"symlink will be created:"
msgstr "在 Windows 上，可以指定 `flags` 参数来控制符号链接的创建方式："

#: ../../src/fs.rst:462
msgid "``UV_FS_SYMLINK_DIR``: indicates that `path` points to a directory."
msgstr "``UV_FS_SYMLINK_DIR``：表示 `path` 指向一个目录。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:464
msgid ""
"``UV_FS_SYMLINK_JUNCTION``: request that the symlink is created using "
"junction points."
msgstr "``UV_FS_SYMLINK_JUNCTION``：请求使用联接点创建符号链接。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:469
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`readlink(2)`. The resulting string is stored in "
"`req->ptr`."
msgstr "等价于 :man:`readlink(2)`。结果字符串存储在 `req->ptr` 中。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:474
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`realpath(3)` on Unix. Windows uses "
"`GetFinalPathNameByHandleW <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-getfinalpathnamebyhandlew>`_. The"
" resulting string is stored in `req->ptr`."
msgstr ""
"在 Unix 上等价于 :man:`realpath(3)`。Windows 使用 `GetFinalPathNameByHandleW"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-getfinalpathnamebyhandlew>`_。"
"结果字符串存储在 `req->ptr` 中。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:478
msgid ""
"This function has certain platform-specific caveats that were discovered "
"when used in Node."
msgstr "此函数存在一些在 Node 中使用时发现的平台相关注意事项。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:480
msgid ""
"macOS and other BSDs: this function will fail with UV_ELOOP if more than "
"32 symlinks are found while resolving the given path.  This limit is "
"hardcoded and cannot be sidestepped."
msgstr ""
"macOS 及其他 BSD：在解析给定路径时，如果发现超过 32 个符号链接，此函数将以"
" UV_ELOOP 失败。该限制是硬编码的，无法规避。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:482
msgid ""
"Windows: while this function works in the common case, there are a number"
" of corner cases where it doesn't:"
msgstr "Windows：虽然此函数在常见情况下可以正常工作，但在若干边缘情况下却不行："

#: ../../src/fs.rst:485
msgid ""
"Paths in ramdisk volumes created by tools which sidestep the Volume "
"Manager (such as ImDisk) cannot be resolved."
msgstr "由绕过卷管理器的工具（例如 ImDisk）创建的 ramdisk 卷中的路径无法解析。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:487
msgid "Inconsistent casing when using drive letters."
msgstr "使用盘符时大小写不一致。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:488
msgid "Resolved path bypasses subst'd drives."
msgstr "解析出的路径会绕过经 subst 映射的驱动器。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:490
msgid ""
"While this function can still be used, it's not recommended if scenarios "
"such as the above need to be supported."
msgstr "此函数仍然可以使用，但如果需要支持上述场景，则不推荐使用。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:493
msgid ""
"The background story and some more details on these issues can be checked"
" `here <https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/7726>`_."
msgstr ""
"这些问题的来龙去脉及更多细节可在 `此处 <https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/7726>`_"
" 查看。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:502
msgid ""
"Equivalent to :man:`chown(2)`, :man:`fchown(2)` and :man:`lchown(2)` "
"respectively."
msgstr "分别等价于 :man:`chown(2)`、:man:`fchown(2)` 和 :man:`lchown(2)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:505
msgid "These functions are not implemented on Windows."
msgstr "这些函数在 Windows 上未实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:507
msgid "implemented uv_fs_lchown"
msgstr "实现了 uv_fs_lchown"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:511
msgid "Returns `req->fs_type`."
msgstr "返回 `req->fs_type`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:517
msgid "Returns `req->result`."
msgstr "返回 `req->result`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:523
msgid ""
"Returns the platform specific error code - `GetLastError()` value on "
"Windows and `-(req->result)` on other platforms."
msgstr ""
"返回平台特定的错误码——Windows 上为 `GetLastError()` 的值，其他平台上为"
" `-(req->result)`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:530
msgid "Returns `req->ptr`."
msgstr "返回 `req->ptr`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:536
msgid "Returns `req->path`."
msgstr "返回 `req->path`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:542
msgid "Returns `&req->statbuf`."
msgstr "返回 `&req->statbuf`。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:546
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_req_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_req_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:549
msgid "Helper functions"
msgstr "辅助函数"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:553
msgid ""
"For a file descriptor in the C runtime, get the OS-dependent handle. On "
"UNIX, returns the ``fd`` intact. On Windows, this calls `_get_osfhandle "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/get-"
"osfhandle?view=vs-2019>`_. Note that the return value is still owned by "
"the C runtime, any attempts to close it or to use it after closing the fd"
" may lead to malfunction."
msgstr ""
"对于 C 运行时中的文件描述符，获取与操作系统相关的句柄。在 UNIX 上，原样返回"
" ``fd``。在 Windows 上，此函数调用 `_get_osfhandle <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/get-osfhandle?view=vs-2019>`_。注意，返回值仍"
"归 C 运行时所有，在关闭 fd 之后关闭它或使用它的任何尝试都可能导致功能异常。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:562
msgid ""
"For a OS-dependent handle, get the file descriptor in the C runtime. On "
"UNIX, returns the ``os_fd`` intact. On Windows, this calls "
"`_open_osfhandle <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-"
"library/reference/open-osfhandle?view=vs-2019>`_. Note that this consumes"
" the argument, any attempts to close it or to use it after closing the "
"return value may lead to malfunction."
msgstr ""
"对于与操作系统相关的句柄，获取 C 运行时中的文件描述符。在 UNIX 上，原样返回"
" ``os_fd``。在 Windows 上，此函数调用 `_open_osfhandle <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/cpp/c-runtime-library/reference/open-osfhandle?view=vs-2019>`_。注意，此函数"
"会消耗传入的参数，在关闭返回值之后关闭它或使用它的任何尝试都可能导致功能异常。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:570
msgid "File open constants"
msgstr "文件打开常量"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:574
msgid ""
"The file is opened in append mode. Before each write, the file offset is "
"positioned at the end of the file."
msgstr "以追加模式打开文件。每次写入之前，文件偏移量都会被定位到文件末尾。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:579
msgid "The file is created if it does not already exist."
msgstr "如果文件尚不存在，则创建该文件。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:583
msgid ""
"File I/O is done directly to and from user-space buffers, which must be "
"aligned. Buffer size and address should be a multiple of the physical "
"sector size of the block device."
msgstr ""
"文件 I/O 直接在用户空间缓冲区与文件之间进行，这些缓冲区必须对齐。缓冲区大小和地"
"址应为块设备物理扇区大小的倍数。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:588
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_DIRECT` is supported on Linux, and on Windows via "
"`FILE_FLAG_NO_BUFFERING <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/fileio/file-buffering>`_. `UV_FS_O_DIRECT` is not "
"supported on macOS."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_DIRECT` 在 Linux 上受支持，在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_FLAG_NO_BUFFERING"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/file-buffering>`_ 实现。"
"`UV_FS_O_DIRECT` 在 macOS 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:594
msgid "If the path is not a directory, fail the open."
msgstr "如果路径不是目录，则打开失败。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:597
msgid "`UV_FS_O_DIRECTORY` is not supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_DIRECTORY` 在 Windows 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:601
msgid ""
"The file is opened for synchronous I/O. Write operations will complete "
"once all data and a minimum of metadata are flushed to disk."
msgstr ""
"以同步 I/O 方式打开文件。一旦所有数据及最少量元数据被刷新到磁盘，写入操作即告完"
"成。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:605
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_DSYNC` is supported on Windows via `FILE_FLAG_WRITE_THROUGH "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/file-"
"buffering>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_DSYNC` 在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_FLAG_WRITE_THROUGH"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/file-buffering>`_ 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:610
msgid "If the `O_CREAT` flag is set and the file already exists, fail the open."
msgstr "如果设置了 `O_CREAT` 标志且文件已存在，则打开失败。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:613
msgid ""
"In general, the behavior of `O_EXCL` is undefined if it is used without "
"`O_CREAT`. There is one exception: on Linux 2.6 and later, `O_EXCL` can "
"be used without `O_CREAT` if pathname refers to a block device. If the "
"block device is in use by the system (e.g., mounted), the open will fail "
"with the error `EBUSY`."
msgstr ""
"一般来说，如果 `O_EXCL` 不与 `O_CREAT` 一起使用，其行为是未定义的。有一个例外：在"
" Linux 2.6 及更高版本上，如果 pathname 指向块设备，`O_EXCL` 可以脱离 `O_CREAT` 单"
"独使用。如果该块设备正被系统占用（例如已挂载），打开将失败并报 `EBUSY` 错误。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:621
msgid "Atomically obtain an exclusive lock."
msgstr "以原子方式获取独占锁。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:624
msgid "`UV_FS_O_EXLOCK` is only supported on macOS and Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_EXLOCK` 仅在 macOS 和 Windows 上受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:626
msgid "support is added for Windows."
msgstr "增加了对 Windows 的支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:630
msgid ""
"Use a memory file mapping to access the file. When using this flag, the "
"file cannot be open multiple times concurrently."
msgstr "使用内存文件映射来访问文件。使用此标志时，该文件不能被并发打开多次。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:634
msgid "`UV_FS_O_FILEMAP` is only supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_FILEMAP` 仅在 Windows 上受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:638
msgid "Do not update the file access time when the file is read."
msgstr "读取文件时不更新文件访问时间。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:641
msgid "`UV_FS_O_NOATIME` is not supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_NOATIME` 在 Windows 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:645
msgid ""
"If the path identifies a terminal device, opening the path will not cause"
" that terminal to become the controlling terminal for the process (if the"
" process does not already have one)."
msgstr ""
"如果路径标识的是一个终端设备，打开该路径不会使该终端成为该进程的控制终端（如果该"
"进程尚未拥有控制终端）。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:650
msgid "`UV_FS_O_NOCTTY` is not supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_NOCTTY` 在 Windows 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:654
msgid "If the path is a symbolic link, fail the open."
msgstr "如果路径是符号链接，则打开失败。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:657
msgid "`UV_FS_O_NOFOLLOW` is not supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_NOFOLLOW` 在 Windows 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:661
msgid "Open the file in nonblocking mode if possible."
msgstr "尽可能以非阻塞模式打开文件。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:664
msgid "`UV_FS_O_NONBLOCK` is not supported on Windows."
msgstr "`UV_FS_O_NONBLOCK` 在 Windows 上不受支持。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:668
msgid ""
"Access is intended to be random. The system can use this as a hint to "
"optimize file caching."
msgstr "访问预期是随机的。系统可将此用作优化文件缓存的提示。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:672
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_RANDOM` is only supported on Windows via "
"`FILE_FLAG_RANDOM_ACCESS <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_RANDOM` 仅在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_FLAG_RANDOM_ACCESS"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_"
" 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:677
msgid "Open the file for read-only access."
msgstr "以只读方式打开文件。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:681
msgid "Open the file for read-write access."
msgstr "以读写方式打开文件。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:685
msgid ""
"Access is intended to be sequential from beginning to end. The system can"
" use this as a hint to optimize file caching."
msgstr "访问预期是从头到尾顺序进行的。系统可将此用作优化文件缓存的提示。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:689
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_SEQUENTIAL` is only supported on Windows via "
"`FILE_FLAG_SEQUENTIAL_SCAN <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_SEQUENTIAL` 仅在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_FLAG_SEQUENTIAL_SCAN"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_"
" 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:694 ../../src/fs.rst:715
msgid "The file is temporary and should not be flushed to disk if possible."
msgstr "该文件是临时的，应尽可能不将其刷新到磁盘。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:697
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_SHORT_LIVED` is only supported on Windows via "
"`FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TEMPORARY <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_SHORT_LIVED` 仅在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TEMPORARY"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_"
" 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:702
msgid "Open the symbolic link itself rather than the resource it points to."
msgstr "打开符号链接本身，而不是它所指向的资源。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:706
msgid ""
"The file is opened for synchronous I/O. Write operations will complete "
"once all data and all metadata are flushed to disk."
msgstr ""
"以同步 I/O 方式打开文件。一旦所有数据及所有元数据被刷新到磁盘，写入操作即告完"
"成。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:710
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_SYNC` is supported on Windows via `FILE_FLAG_WRITE_THROUGH "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/file-"
"buffering>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_SYNC` 在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_FLAG_WRITE_THROUGH"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/fileio/file-buffering>`_ 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:718
msgid ""
"`UV_FS_O_TEMPORARY` is only supported on Windows via "
"`FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TEMPORARY <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_."
msgstr ""
"`UV_FS_O_TEMPORARY` 仅在 Windows 上通过 `FILE_ATTRIBUTE_TEMPORARY"
" <https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-createfilew>`_"
" 实现。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:723
msgid ""
"If the file exists and is a regular file, and the file is opened "
"successfully for write access, its length shall be truncated to zero."
msgstr "如果文件存在且是普通文件，并且以写访问权限成功打开，则其长度将被截断为零。"

#: ../../src/fs.rst:728
msgid "Open the file for write-only access."
msgstr "以只写方式打开文件。"

